  "releaseNotes": "Release notes – Duplicate handler validation\n      ✨ New\n\n      Compile-time validation for duplicate handlers\n\n      Prevents ambiguous dispatch behavior at runtime.\n\n      Fails fast at compile time with clear diagnostics.\n\n      Enforces a strict one handler per message contract, aligned with TinyDispatcher’s opinionated design.\n\n      Added Source Generator unit tests covering:\n\n      Duplicate command handlers\n\n      Duplicate query handlers",
